<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE-ACC Bank H1 pretax profit rises 12 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ACC Bank H1 pretax profit rises 12 percent.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six mths to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.71		  vs 14.88</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.50		   vs 4.25</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    7.47		   vs 6.66</p>
<p> Total operating income 26.10		  vs 23.86</p>
<p>NOTE - ACC Bank's majority shareholder is the Irish government.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
